{"t":"MRNA","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Moderna, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","employees":4700,"hq":"Cambridge, MA, United States","website":"https://www.modernatx.com","summary_en":"Moderna, Inc., a biotechnology company, provides messenger RNA medicines in the United States, Europe, and internationally. The company's respiratory vaccines include spikevax, mNEXSPIKE, mRESVIA, COVID, RSV, seasonal influenza, combination, and pandemic influenza vaccine; latent vaccines comprise cytomegalovirus, epstein-barr virus, and human immunodeficiency virus vaccines; enteric viruses include norovirus; public health vaccines consist of Zika, Nipah, and Mpox vaccines; and bacterial diseases vaccines, such as lyme vaccines. It also provides oncology therapeutics, such as intismeran autogene, cancer antigen therapy, t-cell engager, and cell therapy enhancer; and rare disease products, including propionic and methylmalonic acidemia, and cystic fibrosis. It has strategic alliances and collaborations with Merck & Co., Inc; Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated; Vertex Pharmaceuticals (Europe) Limited; immatics N.V.; Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency; Biomedical Advanced Research and Development Authority; Institute for Life Changing Medicines; The Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation; and OpenAI. The company was formerly known as Moderna Therapeutics, Inc. and changed its name to Moderna, Inc. in August 2018. Moderna, Inc. was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"생명공학 회사인 Moderna, Inc.는 미국, 유럽 및 국제적으로 메신저 RNA 의약품을 제공합니다. 이 회사의 호흡기 백신에는 스파이크백스(spikevax), mNEXSPIKE, mRESVIA, COVID, RSV, 계절성 인플루엔자, 복합 및 유행성 인플루엔자 백신이 포함됩니다. 잠복 백신은 거대세포바이러스, 엡스타인-바 바이러스 및 인간 면역결핍 바이러스 백신을 포함하며; 장내 바이러스에는 노로바이러스가 포함되며; 공중 보건 백신은 Zika, Nipah 및 Mpox 백신으로 구성됩니다. 및 라임 백신과 같은 세균성 질병 백신. 또한 장내 자가유전자(intismeran autogene), 암항원 치료, T세포 참여자, 세포 치료 강화제 등의 종양 치료제도 제공합니다. 프로피온산 및 메틸말론산혈증, 낭포성 섬유증을 포함한 희귀질환 제품. Merck & Co., Inc.와 전략적 제휴 및 협력 관계를 맺고 있습니다. Vertex Pharmaceuticals 통합; Vertex Pharmaceuticals (유럽) Limited; 이매틱스 N.V.; 국방고등연구계획국; 생물의학 첨단 연구 개발 기관; 삶을 변화시키는 의약품 연구소; 빌 & 멜린다 게이츠 재단; 그리고 오픈AI. 이 회사는 이전에 Moderna Therapeutics, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2018년 8월에 Moderna, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Moderna, Inc.는 2010년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 케임브리지에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":241.46,"mcap":96399507456.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-52.65993,"peg":null,"ps":43.267284,"pb":14.249632,"ev_ebitda":-42.163,"div":0.0,"beta":1.166,"hi52":260.67,"lo52":22.28},"fin":{"rev":2228000000.0,"rev_g":0.021,"eps_g":null,"gross":-0.66023004,"op":-5.5793104,"net":-1.41427,"roe":-0.38998002,"fcf":299249984.0,"cash":5137999872.0,"debt":1287000064.0,"de":19.036,"eps":-7.98,"feps":-4.58527},"own":{"short":0.0998,"inst":0.80398005,"insider":0.07356},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":138.36842,"median":125.0,"high":251.0,"low":45.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.95652,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":3,"hold":15,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":15,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":17,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"William Blair","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":230.0,"priorPriceTarget":167.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":90.0,"priorPriceTarget":40.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":137.0,"priorPriceTarget":120.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-07","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade"